name: sim.setIkGroupProperties
description: Sets properties of an IK group.
luaSynopsis: sim.setIkGroupProperties(int ikGroupHandle,int resolutionMethod,int maxIterations,float damping)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. ikGroupHandle: handle of the IK group
2. resolutionMethod: the IK resolution method
3. maxIterations: the maximum number of iteractions for the calculations
4. damping: the damping factor.
5. reserved: reserved for future extensions. Keep at nullptr
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
